# AutoPulse product context

AutoPulse is an opinionated, **FastAPI-native** observability product for solo developers and small backend teams (1–5). It is **not** a full Grafana/Datadog/Sentry replacement for the MVP.

## Core promise

Useful visibility into a FastAPI app in **~two minutes**, without learning observability infrastructure.

## Product rule

If a feature makes the user think like an **observability engineer**, it does **not** belong in the MVP.

## MVP must answer

What broke, when did it break, and what requests led to it?

## Explicit non-goals (MVP)

Distributed tracing, custom dashboard builder, query language, complex alert rules, Kubernetes/multi-cloud integrations, log transformation pipelines, full APM agent behavior, enterprise permissions and audit logs.

## Dashboard principle

Optimize for **fast diagnosis**, not configurability. Target: understand what is broken in **~five seconds** on the overview.

## Positioning anchor

The user **refuses to configure observability** — guide product, docs, dashboard, SDK defaults, and pricing simplicity accordingly.

When scope is ambiguous, prefer **DEVELOPMENT.md** at the repo root as source of truth.
